---
const videos = [
  { caption: '视频占位 ①' },
  { caption: '视频占位 ②' },
];
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-28">
  <p class="reveal chapter-tag mb-6 text-sm">第三章 · 光影回忆</p>

  <h2 class="reveal text-glow mb-4 text-center text-4xl md:text-5xl" data-annotation="underline">
    会流动的时光
  </h2>

  <p class="reveal mb-14 text-center font-hand text-lg text-ink-soft">
    有些瞬间，用画面留不住，就用影像吧
  </p>

  <div class="space-y-10">
    {
      videos.map((v) => (
        <figure class="glass reveal overflow-hidden p-3 md:p-4">
          <div class="video-placeholder">
            <span>🎬</span>
            <p>{v.caption}</p>
          </div>
        </figure>
      ))
    }
  </div>
</section>
